      "created_at": "2016-02-02T23:05:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So achievements sync now across devices, which is very cool, and as someone with multiple android devices, I thank you for that. &nbsp;However, it seems that pre-requisities for achievements don't. &nbsp;On one tablet, I lost with all of the F6 to Legacy, and then I freed up F6 Tempest and F6 AZ, and those sync-ed over nicely to my other tablet. &nbsp;Today, I spent a lot time cranking out all the requirements to get Bunker, Tachyon, and Unity in one game, but when the game ended, no unlocks. &nbsp;My guess is that while the achievements sync over, the pre-requisite of losing to IL did NOT sync over.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I realize it's kinda random, but any chance of a fix?</p>",
